{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01340","headline":"相和歌辞 长信怨 · 王諲","name":"相和歌辞 长信怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞燕倚身轻，争人巧笑名。\n生君弃妾意，增妾怨君情。\n日落昭阳殿，秋来长信城。\n寥寥金殿里，歌吹夜无声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王諲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01340.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01340","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}